 "notes": "Extracted from Figure 4 (bottom panel) showing limits on axion-nucleon coupling from axion-wind spin-precession effect (\u03bdn/\u03bdHg analysis). Limits assume axions saturate local DM density of 0.4 GeV/cm\u00b3. Converted from CN/fa (GeV^-1) to canonical g_an using g_an = 2*m_n*(CN/fa) with m_n = 0.939565 GeV. This represents the first laboratory constraints on axion-nucleon coupling linear in the interaction constant, improving previous laboratory bounds by up to factor of 40. The paper also reports first laboratory constraints on axion-gluon coupling; both analyses are from the same nEDM experiment conducted at PSI (2015-2016) and ILL (1998-2002).",
